id: pmc-dependency-bump-case
title: Recognize capitalized Dependabot bump subjects in dependency-only releases
description: "Fix issue 343 in the shared dependency subject matcher, preserving strict subject shape and original description case. Verify CLI pending and tagged dependency-only release windows."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-changelog#343"
created_at: "2026-11-11T23:37:37.766Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-11T23:49:38.317Z"
author: codex-sol
comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-11T23:37:39.707Z",codex-sol,"Read issue 343 and its comment in full. No imported item matched the issue tag or title in the current tracker, so created this item. Fresh fix/dependency-bump-subject-case branch starts at origin/main; PR 341 and its branch remain untouched. Plan: change only the shared matcher and its explanatory comments; add strict parser controls and real-Git CLI release/tag stability, semver and check coverage. Preserve description case without lowercasing and retain existing first-letter capitalization and PR extraction. Regenerate through changelog:full."
  "2026-11-11T23:39:16.950Z",codex-sol,"Consumer audit: DEPENDABOT_SUBJECT is tested only by parseDependencyCommit; readDependencyCommits calls that parser. enrichSectionsWithDependencyCommits reads both single and all-tag windows; selectChangelogSections supplies createChangelog, assertRequestedRelease, structured documents, summaries, visibleChangelogItems and suggestSemver. writeChangelog and CLI check/drift render through createChangelog. No copied subject regex or separate classifier was found. Focused parser plus real-Git CLI tests pass 13/13. Existing parser rejects breaking-marker subjects, and that behavior is now explicit. No check-drift.test.ts exists on this base; test/check-diff.test.ts is the existing drift suite."
  "2026-11-11T23:40:07.144Z",codex-sol,"Behavioral proof completed with the same 13 focused tests: restoring the original lowercase-only matcher fails all 4 new case-acceptance tests and all 4 CLI regressions (8 failures; 5 refusal controls still pass as intended). An overbroad matcher accepting wrong verbs, wrong or absent scope, and the breaking marker fails every refusal control plus all 4 CLI regressions (9 failures). Restoring the intended matcher passes all 13 with zero skips. This separates behavioral reverts from unchanged exclusion controls rather than claiming the stricter old matcher should fail refusals."
  "2026-11-11T23:44:41.091Z",codex-sol,"First bounded 19-file gate completed in 201.5 seconds: 671 tests, 655 passed, 16 failed, zero skips. All failures are existing generator completeness fixtures asserting empty stderr; installed pm-cli is 2026.10.27 despite the manifest and lockfile declaring 2026.11.7, so project_runtime_stale_read warnings invalidate those assertions. Restore dependencies from the unchanged lockfile and rerun the same scope; do not alter assertions, package pins or consumer repos."
  "2026-11-11T23:44:59.148Z",codex-sol,"Dependency restoration completed via timeout 1200 npm ci --ignore-scripts: installed pm-cli now matches the unchanged lockfile at 2026.11.7. No manifest or lockfile changes. Rerun build, test compilation and the identical 19-file test command before final typecheck and changelog checks."
  "2026-11-11T23:48:37.828Z",codex-sol,"The identical bounded 19-file gate passes after restoring declared dependencies: 671 tests passed, zero failures/skips/cancellations, 186.9 seconds. Rebuilt tracked dist matcher artifacts and test compilation also pass. The initial 16 completeness failures were caused by dependency-install drift and required no code or test changes. Full-suite certification is left to CI per the requested budget."
  "2026-11-11T23:49:37.062Z",codex-sol,"Final gates pass: timeout 1200 npm run build; timeout 1200 npm run build:test; the recorded 19-file node --test command (671/671); timeout 1200 npm run typecheck; timeout 1200 npm run changelog:full; timeout 1200 npm run changelog:check (including links). CHANGELOG.md regenerated byte-identically through the package flow; this in-progress item is not prematurely published as completed work. All commands stayed below 20 minutes. Test-result tracking is disabled by project policy, so these comments preserve the results."
  "2026-11-11T23:49:37.681Z",codex-sol,"Final consumer references: src/generator.ts:114 matcher, :193 parser, :262 and :281 all-tag/single-window collection, :305 and :385 markdown, :487 requested-release guard, :565 JSON, :618 summary, :914 writer/check and :2505 semver-visible items; src/cli.ts:275, :345, :354 and :375 guard/semver/check/drift. Additional shared-pipeline consumers: src/index.ts:15 public parser export; src/extension.ts:349, :415, :440 and :574 host generation/semver/check/export; src/release-membership.ts:80 and src/claim-audit.ts:155. No independent regex classifier found. Ready for a focused PR; full-suite CI remains pending, and PR 341 is untouched. Release only this claim and leave status in_progress for orchestrator verification."
